{"type":"message","id":"5f532aa2","parentId":"574e1515","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:15:44.633Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 03:15 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为干活小弟，修改新爬虫的报告生成逻辑：\n1. 进入爬虫项目目录：/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/v2/\n2. 修改src/report.js文件，移除TXT格式生成逻辑，只保留MD格式和DOCX格式两种输出\n3. 确保生成流程正常，DOCX转换逻辑不变，仍然保留中文排版适配和容错处理\n修改完成后说明改动点。"}],"timestamp":1773429344632}}
